<CapabilityStatement xmlns="http://hl7.org/fhir">
  <id value="MHDResponder"/>
  <text>
    <status value="extensions"/><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p class="res-header-id"><b>Generated Narrative: DeclaracionDeCapacidad MHDResponder</b></p><a name="MHDResponder"> </a><a name="hcMHDResponder"> </a><h2 id="title">MHD Responder</h2><ul><li>Implementation Guide Version: 0.1.0 </li><li>FHIR Version: 4.0.1 </li><li>Supported Formats: <code>application/fhir+json</code>, <code>application/fhir+xml</code></li><li>Published on: 2026-09-02 </li><li>Published by: Hl7 Chile </li></ul><blockquote class="impl-note"><p><strong>Note to Implementers: FHIR Capabilities</strong></p><p>Any FHIR capability may be 'allowed' by the system unless explicitly marked as 'SHALL NOT'. A few items are marked as MAY in the Implementation Guide to highlight their potential relevance to the use case.</p></blockquote><p>This CapabilityStatement instantiates these CapabilityStatements <a href="https://profiles.ihe.net/ITI/MHD/4.2.5/CapabilityStatement-IHE.MHD.DocumentRecipient.html">Document Recipient</a>, <a href="https://profiles.ihe.net/ITI/MHD/4.2.5/CapabilityStatement-IHE.MHD.DocumentResponder.html">Document Responder (server)</a></p><h3 id="shallIGs">SHALL Support the Following Implementation Guides</h3><ul><li><a href="index.html">https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/mhd/ImplementationGuide/hl7.fhir.cl.mhdig</a></li></ul><h2 id="rest">FHIR RESTful Capabilities</h2><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 id="mode1" class="panel-title">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class="panel-body"><div><p>Servidor MHD local que permite registrar, consultar y recuperar
documentos clínicos utilizando las transacciones definidas por
IHE MHD y los perfiles definidos por esta guía.</p>
</div><div class="lead"><em>Security</em></div><blockquote><div><p>Las transacciones deben realizarse mediante HTTPS y aplicar los
mecanismos de autenticación, autorización, control de acceso,
auditoría y trazabilidad definidos para la infraestructura.</p>
</div></blockquote><div class="lead"><em>Summary of System-wide Interactions</em></div><ul><li>Supports the <code>transaction</code>interaction described as follows:<div><p>ITI-65 Provide Document Bundle.</p>
<p>El servidor SHALL aceptar un Bundle transaction conforme al perfil
BundleMhd:</p>
<p>https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/mhd/StructureDefinition/BundleMhd</p>
</div></li><li>Supports the <code>search-system</code>interaction described as follows:<div><p>Búsqueda a nivel de sistema de acuerdo con las capacidades
definidas para IHE MHD Document Responder.</p>
</div></li></ul></div></div><h3 id="resourcesCap1">Capabilities by Resource/Profile</h3><h4 id="resourcesSummary1">Summary</h4><p>The summary table lists the resources that are part of this configuration, and for each resource it lists:</p><ul><li>The relevant profiles (if any)</li><li>The interactions supported by each resource (<b><span class="bg-info">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class="bg-info">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class="bg-info">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class="bg-info">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class="bg-info">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class="bg-info">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class="bg-info">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class="bg-info">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class="bg-info">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class="bg-info">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class="bg-info">T</span></b>ype are only present if at least one of the resources has support for them.</li><li><span>The required, recommended, and some optional search parameters (if any). </span></li><li>The linked resources enabled for <code>_include</code></li><li>The other resources enabled for <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>The operations on the resource (if any)</li></ul><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-condensed table-hover"><thead><tr><th><b>Resource Type</b></th><th><b>Perfil</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="GET a resource (read interaction)">R</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="GET all set of resources of the type (search interaction)">S</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="PUT a new resource version (update interaction)">U</b></th><th class="text-center"><b title="POST a new resource (create interaction)">C</b></th><th><b title="Required and recommended search parameters">Searches</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operations</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#DocumentReference1-1">DocumentReference</a></td><td><a href="StructureDefinition-ReferenciaDocumental.html">https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/mhd/StructureDefinition/ReferenciaDocumental</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td>_id, _lastupdated, author.given, author.family, category, creation, date, event, facility, format, identifier, patient, patient.identifier, period, related, security-label, setting, status, type</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href="#List1-2">List</a></td><td><a href="StructureDefinition-ListMhd.html">https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/mhd/StructureDefinition/ListMhd</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td>_id, _lastupdated, code, date, identifier, patient, patient.identifier, source.given, source.family, status, designationType, sourceId</td><td/><td/><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 id="DocumentReference1-1" class="panel-title"><span style="float: right;">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>DocumentReference</h4></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-ReferenciaDocumental.html">ReferenciaDocumental</a></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Reference Policy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>read</code><br/><code>search-type</code><div><p>ITI-67 Find Document References.
Permite localizar referencias documentales mediante los parámetros
de búsqueda definidos por IHE MHD y esta guía.</p>
</div></li></ul></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-7"><span class="lead">Search Parameters</span><table class="table table-condensed table-hover"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_id</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_lastupdated</td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>author.given</td><td><code>string</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>author.family</td><td><code>string</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>category</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>creation</td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>date</td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>event</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>facility</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>format</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>identifier</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>patient</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>patient.identifier</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>period</td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>related</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>security-label</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>setting</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>status</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>type</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="col-lg-5"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 id="List1-2" class="panel-title"><span style="float: right;">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>List</h4></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-ListMhd.html">ListMhd</a></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Reference Policy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>read</code><br/><code>search-type</code><div><p>ITI-66 Find Document Lists.
